          <rdf:li>Protective Hordak</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>villains trying to be better people</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Confused Catra</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>needlessly terrified Bow</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Hordak will retroactively adopt the entire Horde</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>F/F</rdf:li>
